  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull;Moonskyn is a skincare studio that puts emphasis on embracing your natural beauty. O<span>ur purpose is to help women take care of their skin &amp; their body in the most effective way. We soon realized that a healthy &amp; efficient beauty routine for the modern women needs simplicity &amp; consistency. We wanted to help our clients take the in-salon experience home with a professional beauty routine that drives results and is easy to implement in a day- to -day modern lifestyle, Our natural skincare line&nbsp; for all skin types launched to give women an affordable &amp; simple way to make their skincare a priority.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;Moon Oil is a transformative blend of precious oils that restore a blemish-free, nourished glow to your skin. Blue Tansy, Raspberry Seed, and Pomegranate Seed Oils soothe, repair, and protect the skin, preventing dehydration and adding firmness.</p>\r\n<div class=\"standard__rte font--3 columns--1 aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-order=\"3\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>WHAT MAKES SO SPECIAL?</strong></p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Made of 100% pure, potent botanical oils, the Moon Oil is a lightweight, brightening face oil brimming with essential vitamins, minerals, and antioxidants that nourish the skin from the outside in.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><a href=\"https://moonskyn.com/products/moon-oil\" class=\"standard__cta hero__btn btn btn--large btn--outline caps btn--neutral aos-init aos-animate\" data-aos=\"hero\" data-aos-order=\"4\"></a><br>&bull; Payment terms: Pay through Paypal or bank Transfer&nbsp;<br><br></p>",
